		(descr "Murata BLM18KG601SN1D on inherited BRK-derived pads; reference/model geometry retained, not exact Murata recommended lands. V4 replaces MI0603J601R-10 with Murata BLM18KG601SN1D, JLC C85833. 600ohm+/-25% at100MHz retained; DCR<=0.15ohm initial (0.165ohm after tests); 1.3A at85C/1A at125C ambient, derating applies. Same1.6x0.8x0.8mm body tolerances. Inherited BRK-derived lands, mask/paste, placement and wires retained; these lands differ from Murata recommended reflow example. Positive terminal overlap reviewed. Filtering under DC bias, EMI, stencil process and powered operation are not established as identical. Murata JENF243A_0003AN-01 pp2,5,10. https://pim.murata.com/asset/pim4/ferriteBeadInductortypefilter/ENFA0003_PDF_FERRITEBEADINDUCTORTYPEFILTER")
