		(property "Selection_note" "Schematic V2 (Claude, 24 Nov 2026, approved by Howard): XAL5030-332MEC C5342047 (-7 orderable, read 24 Nov 2026, 18:33 CST) -> XAL5030-222MEC C920280. Same Coilcraft XAL5030 size code, so footprint L_Coilcraft_XAL5030-332MEC (name kept) is unchanged (the XAL5030 drawing in Doc 908-1 was not text-read; confirm the land against it). Coilcraft Doc 908-1 rev 02/26/26 p.1: 2.2 uH +/-20%, DCR 13.2/14.5 mohm typ/max, Isat 9.2 A (30% drop, typ), Irms 7.2 A (20 C rise); was 3.3 uH, 23.3 mohm max, 8.7 A, 5.9 A. Ripple about 1.55 A p-p at 12 V in, 700 kHz; hot saturation, losses and stability with about 87.5 uF Cout remain unqualified."
